		"description": "<p>When you roll Initiative, gain DEX Bursts of Speed to use during that encounter.</p><p>(1/turn) You may spend 1 Burst of Speed to use any of the following maneuvers for free:</p><p>• <strong>Slipstream</strong>. Defend, and the attack misses.</p><p>• <strong>Whirling Defense</strong>. Defend and apply your armor to every attack this round.</p><p>• <strong>Swiftstrike</strong>. Attack on your turn, and ignore disadvantage from Rushed Attacks.</p><p>• <strong>Windstep</strong>. Move on your turn, ignoring difficult terrain.</p>",
